Question. 14 Write a query to display the employee ID, first name, last name, salary of all employees whose salary is above average for their departments.

SELECT 
    employee_id, 
    first_name, 
    last_name, 
    salary 
FROM employees e 
WHERE salary > (
    SELECT AVG(salary) 
    FROM employees 
    WHERE department_id = e.department_id
);
